cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this survey or catalog, please cite the arXiv preprint."
title: "Embedding Physics Priors in Robot Learning: A Survey"
abstract: >-
  A living catalog of robot-learning methods that embed physics priors,
  classified by how physics is embedded: physics-guided inputs, data and
  representations; physics-encoded model architectures; and physics-informed
  training losses.
type: software
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/TUM-AVS/survey-physics-embedded-robot-learning"
keywords:
  - robot learning
  - physics priors
  - physics-informed machine learning
  - scientific machine learning
  - robotics
